      "Bridge force timer starts before ABORT; Forward joins the actual Bridge timer callback as well as its own cancellation callback",
      "OIC early return/Run completion and Forward outer drain have no overlapping Reader; Stream keeps original readMu.TryLock policy",
      "Stream first closing D includes ABORT time; original ABORT2s cap remains, Completed keeps original drain"
